                    <p>All passengers who intend to travel to Saudi Arabia are required to comply with a number of preventive measures during the COVID-19 pandemic, including any applicable Points of Entry provisions in local or international health regulations – the violations of which are subject to prosecution. <strong><a target="_blank" href="https://www.srilankan.com/en_uk/corporate/emergency-news-detail/521">Read more</a></strong></p>
